; v0.7 2026-08-09: the pic banks now hold ONLY pics. Forte's big sprite pass
; pushed "Pics 4" five bytes past a full bank and, once that was fixed, "Pics 1"
; and "Pics 2" past theirs too - they were sharing their banks with Battle
; Engine 3/4/5 (259+189+265 B) and Slot Machines (2562 B). Those four are all
; reached through symbolic BANK(...), so nothing pins them here; they now float
; and the linker puts them wherever there is room. This buys the artwork about
; 3.2 KB of headroom across the five banks for the next round of swaps.
ROMX $9
	"Pics 1"
ROMX $A
	"Pics 2"
ROMX $B
	"Pics 3"
ROMX $C
	"Pics 4"
ROMX $D
	"Pics 5"
ROMX $E
	"Move Flavor Text 5"
	"Battle Engine 6"
ROMX $F
	"Battle Core"
