	; v0.7: pinned here on purpose. Left floating, the linker first-fitted it
	; into the "Maps 4" bank and took that bank from 2.4 KB free down to 676 B
	; -- and the map banks are the ones that actually grow, every time a map is
	; redrawn. The cry banks are frozen data, so this is space that was never
	; going to be wanted by anything else.
	"Move Info"
