ROMX $42
	; AUDIO_5: the five city themes plus a full mirror of the bank-1 SFX+cry
	; table. The headers MUST sit at the top of the bank: sound ids are
	; (header - $4000) / 3, computed cross-bank against SFX_Headers_1, and
	; that subtraction only works because every audio bank starts with its
	; header tables at $4000 -- same layout as $02/$08/$1F/$20 above.
	"Sound Effect Headers 5"
	"Music Headers 5"
	"Sound Effects 5"
	"Audio Engine 5"
	"Music 5"
